WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.560
While preparing for
her school trip,

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.130
Mitsuki's illness takes a turn for the worse,
and she collapses!

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:08.260
She can't even go
on the trip anymore.

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:12.900
What's worse, her grandmother
wants her to get surgery!

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:16.060
But Mitsuki firmly refuses,
saying she doesn't want to lose her voice.

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:19.560
Things are going to be tense between
Mitsuki and her grandmother again!

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:22.760
So, I wonder what's
going to happen today...

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:28.530
Got that?

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:29.660
Yes.

00:02:02.700 --> 00:02:04.600
It feels so good!

00:02:04.660 --> 00:02:06.700
Yeah. The sky sure is high.

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:10.900
It was worth coming out early.
Right, Mitsuki?

00:02:13.160 --> 00:02:15.430
Hey, you can't keep being so glum.

00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:18.100
That old lady is always unpleasant, right?

00:02:18.330 --> 00:02:20.130
Yeah, but...

00:02:22.430 --> 00:02:23.300
<i>Do as you like.</i>

00:02:25.330 --> 00:02:28.500
She hasn't talked to me
much since then.

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:31.800
Even so, it won't do any good
to be depressed.

00:02:31.860 --> 00:02:34.500
Right. Nothing gets done
when you mope around.

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:36.230
Yeah. But...

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:37.530
Jeez!

00:02:39.230 --> 00:02:42.630
Everyone will only worry if you
go to school with a look like that.

00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:47.130
How about we take a different route
as a change of pace?

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:50.530
Wow, that's amazing!

00:02:57.360 --> 00:02:58.560
How beautiful.

00:02:58.600 --> 00:03:03.030
Yeah. I didn't know there was
such a lovely place nearby.

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:05.560
Oh, it's so romantic.

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:08.760
I'd like to come here with Takuto
sometime, just the two of us.

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:12.400
<i>Wait, Meroko!</i>

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:15.530
<i>Over here!</i>

00:03:23.460 --> 00:03:25.360
Mitsuki, it's about time to go.

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:26.030
Yeah.

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:28.960
Oh wait! Takuto!

00:03:35.830 --> 00:03:37.260
<i>I wonder if he lives here.</i>

00:03:40.930 --> 00:03:41.660
Mitsuki.

00:03:42.460 --> 00:03:44.100
What're you doing? Let's go!

00:03:44.130 --> 00:03:45.160
O-Okay.

00:03:57.530 --> 00:04:01.800
Oh, that place used to be the mansion
of someone named Sanada.

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:03.030
Sanada?

00:04:03.330 --> 00:04:06.630
Yes, I heard that he's the head
of a large company

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:09.060
and that he lived alone in the mansion.

00:04:09.130 --> 00:04:12.130
But he may have moved.

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:12.800
What?

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:15.460
If I recall, it's vacant now.

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:20.200
With nobody to succeed him,
it was probably donated somewhere.

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:23.200
That's enough.

00:04:24.430 --> 00:04:27.760
It's despicable gossiping
so much about others.

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:29.600
I-I'm sorry.

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:32.130
Okay, I've got to get to work.

00:04:35.900 --> 00:04:37.230
Does it bother you that much?

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:39.200
He was just an ordinary gentleman.

00:04:39.260 --> 00:04:43.300
Well, his fine graying hair
made him seem refined and nice.

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:46.060
Anyway, I'm gonna go again.

00:04:49.530 --> 00:04:50.660
<i>After all...</i>

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:55.500
<i>I'm curious why he looked</i>
<i>so surprised when he saw me.</i>

00:05:19.230 --> 00:05:21.000
That gentleman isn't here.

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:21.860
Yeah.

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:24.060
You guys!

00:05:25.560 --> 00:05:26.960
Sure enough, you're the ones
from this morning.

00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:30.760
Sure enough, the two in back
are with that girl.

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:33.300
- Huh? The two in back?!
- Huh? The two in back?!

00:05:36.300 --> 00:05:39.030
W-Why?
Why can someone else see us?

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:41.730
He's the second person after her!

00:05:42.100 --> 00:05:43.700
<i>There is someone other than me.</i>

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:46.800
<i>Someone who can see Death Spirits.</i>

00:05:50.260 --> 00:05:51.100
Mr. Sanada?

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:54.200
Then you lived in the mansion?

00:05:54.400 --> 00:05:57.360
Yes. I wanted to be helpful
to people at the end at least,

00:05:57.400 --> 00:05:59.060
so I donated all of the land.

00:05:59.530 --> 00:06:01.730
And so I'm living here now.

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:04.300
Oh, sure enough,
it doesn't say anything.

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:07.160
How is it that you can see us?

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:12.700
It seems that Death Spirit
is cautious of me.

00:06:12.730 --> 00:06:16.100
I'm sorry.
It seems Takuto is in a bad mood.

00:06:16.260 --> 00:06:18.300
Meroko!
Don't say anything unnecessary!

00:06:19.260 --> 00:06:21.000
Takuto and Meroko, huh?

00:06:21.300 --> 00:06:23.730
Oh... Umm... I'm Mitsuki Koyama.

00:06:24.260 --> 00:06:26.830
Mitsuki... That's a cute name.

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:29.300
Enough about that. Answer us!

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:35.300
Well, that's simple.
A Death Spirit appeared before me too.

00:06:36.630 --> 00:06:39.830
I was told that I had one year to live.

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:45.160
I was shocked at first, but now it's
as if I'm just waiting for that day.

00:06:45.430 --> 00:06:49.000
No way! What about your family?
They'll all be sad!

00:06:49.560 --> 00:06:50.700
I don't have any family.

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:51.330
Huh?

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:55.330
They've all died.

00:06:57.300 --> 00:07:01.460
I was successful in business and
had a wonderful family around me.

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:04.030
It was a happy life.

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:09.000
But I grew busier
with work day by day,

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:11.860
and I became unable to spend
enough time with my family.

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:20.700
One Sunday, I put work ahead of
a commitment with my son.

00:07:20.900 --> 00:07:23.300
<i>Shall we even out this area?</i>

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:24.200
<i>Okay.</i>

00:07:37.660 --> 00:07:39.300
It was an accident that
happened in an instant.

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:44.530
From then on, I became
more absorbed in work.

00:07:46.060 --> 00:07:48.500
It was painful to think
about my dead son.

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:56.060
My wife and I stopped talking and
we became complete strangers.

00:07:57.760 --> 00:08:00.800
And then three years ago,
even my wife...

00:08:07.160 --> 00:08:09.960
I was left alone.

00:08:12.560 --> 00:08:15.130
Why didn't I value my family?

00:08:15.860 --> 00:08:18.160
Why couldn't I share my feelings
with my wife?

00:08:19.130 --> 00:08:20.800
I agonized with regrets of that.

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:25.800
It made it painful to even live.

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:31.600
It was at that time when the Death Spirit
appeared before me.

00:08:44.860 --> 00:08:46.130
At first I was shocked.

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:49.600
To be honest, all I thought
was that I didn't want to die.

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:56.100
But now, I'll finally be
able to see them again.

00:08:57.000 --> 00:09:00.800
This time, I'll be able to
really listen to them.

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:04.500
Me too! I'm the same!

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:07.030
I have until next spring.

00:09:07.660 --> 00:09:09.500
I knew it.

00:09:12.100 --> 00:09:16.630
Aren't you guys ashamed to
take the life of such a little girl?!

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:18.760
Oh... Well...

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:21.460
Umm... It's our job.

00:09:22.130 --> 00:09:26.160
Mr. Sanada, Takuto and Meroko
are dear friends of mine.

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:27.330
Friends?

00:09:27.430 --> 00:09:28.200
Yes.

00:09:29.560 --> 00:09:32.260
And if they weren't with me, I...

00:09:34.530 --> 00:09:36.730
Takuto, turn me into Full Moon!

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:37.560
Huh?

00:09:38.100 --> 00:09:42.160
I want Mr. Sanada to understand that
you two are my dear friends.

00:09:42.630 --> 00:09:43.900
So...okay?

00:09:45.530 --> 00:09:46.400
Got it.

00:10:13.660 --> 00:10:14.560
This is...

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:18.160
Takuto and Meroko made
my dream come true.

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:20.900
My dream to get the songs I love

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:23.230
to resound within the heart
of the person I love.

00:10:23.460 --> 00:10:24.230
Songs...

00:10:24.400 --> 00:10:25.130
Yes!

00:10:25.730 --> 00:10:28.300
That is what's most
important to me now.

00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:34.900
I see. I've seen you on TV before.

00:10:35.130 --> 00:10:38.600
I see. So Takuto and Meroko
were helping you, huh?

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:39.660
Yes.

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:42.860
It seems you're kind Death Spirits.

00:10:42.900 --> 00:10:44.660
Well, not really.

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:49.100
You're so mean, Takuto!

00:10:50.360 --> 00:10:52.560
Why are you being so
disrespectful to your senior?

00:10:52.600 --> 00:10:53.600
I'm not.

00:10:53.900 --> 00:10:55.460
They're quite lively, aren't they?

00:10:55.560 --> 00:10:56.360
Yes.

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:12.730
Mr. Sanada!

00:11:24.430 --> 00:11:25.560
Here you go.

00:11:26.860 --> 00:11:27.830
Thank you.

00:11:47.360 --> 00:11:50.760
Those two have totally
become friends.

00:11:51.460 --> 00:11:55.360
I wonder if people who can see Death Spirits
have some kind of connection.

00:11:56.800 --> 00:11:58.100
- At any rate,
- Was it a little scary?

00:11:58.130 --> 00:12:00.230
- Mr. Sanada sure is cheerful, isn't he?
- No, it was a lot of fun!

00:12:00.260 --> 00:12:02.560
- Despite having only a short time to live.
- That's good.

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:06.600
But why can only those two see us?

00:12:06.800 --> 00:12:07.560
Yeah.

00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:09.530
It's a mystery.

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:12.830
What? These roses...

00:12:13.430 --> 00:12:16.230
Mr. Sanada.
When are these roses going to bloom?

00:12:16.560 --> 00:12:18.860
Oh, I think they'll be blooming soon.

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:22.300
My wife took great care of them
until she died.

00:12:23.530 --> 00:12:27.160
She was really looking
forward to them blooming.

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:39.100
Hey, are you okay?

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:40.930
Is it that bitter?

00:12:41.130 --> 00:12:42.730
No, I'm fine.

00:12:45.130 --> 00:12:47.460
Say, Takuto. I have a favor to ask.

00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:48.360
What is it?

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:52.700
I'd like you guys to wait just a little longer
before collecting Mr. Sanada's life.

00:12:53.900 --> 00:12:57.030
I bet Mr. Sanada wants
to see those roses.

00:12:57.230 --> 00:13:00.400
You know, he looked very
lonesome back there.

00:13:00.660 --> 00:13:01.600
But you know, Mitsuki...

00:13:01.630 --> 00:13:05.460
Please! At the very least,
until his wife's precious roses bloom.

00:13:05.500 --> 00:13:06.200
There's no way!

00:13:07.130 --> 00:13:08.430
That's impossible.

00:13:09.800 --> 00:13:11.530
If I could do such a thing,
I'd have long since...

00:13:12.700 --> 00:13:15.360
<i>I'd have long since</i>
<i>saved Mitsuki's life.</i>

00:13:16.430 --> 00:13:18.060
But... But you know, Takuto...

00:13:18.100 --> 00:13:21.060
Anyway, we can't do
what we can't do!

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:24.460
Takuto...

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:28.660
You know, Mitsuki,
all we do is collect the soul

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:30.630
when the time limit of the life runs out.

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:34.560
Determining the length...
is outside of our jurisdiction.

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:35.830
I see.

00:13:37.530 --> 00:13:38.300
Yes.

00:13:39.600 --> 00:13:40.560
I'm sorry.

00:13:52.300 --> 00:13:54.560
You're not gonna go with her today?

00:13:56.630 --> 00:13:59.000
You don't have to be so angry.

00:13:59.700 --> 00:14:01.560
I can't help but be angry!

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:03.830
Oh Takuto! Jeez.

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:07.100
Wait! Takuto!

00:14:10.500 --> 00:14:13.360
Hey! Takuto and Meroko!

00:14:21.600 --> 00:14:23.360
Well, I'm glad I could see you guys.

00:14:24.030 --> 00:14:26.000
As a matter of fact, I have something
I want to consult you guys about.

00:14:26.230 --> 00:14:29.960
What is it?
We're on our way to Mitsuki.

00:14:30.100 --> 00:14:30.930
Takuto!

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:35.900
Actually, I wanted to talk
to you about Mitsuki.

00:14:37.360 --> 00:14:41.260
Would you be able to
give my life to her?

00:14:44.260 --> 00:14:47.400
It's unbearable to think that
she has such a fate.

00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:52.100
There may not be much left,
but I want to give her my remaining life.

00:14:52.930 --> 00:14:54.230
So can you guys...

00:14:54.260 --> 00:14:55.030
There's no way.

00:14:56.330 --> 00:14:58.160
It's impossible for us.

00:14:58.760 --> 00:15:03.530
We can't... With our power,
we can't change fate.

00:15:08.900 --> 00:15:11.060
I thought Mitsuki was an idiot,

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:13.830
but Mr. Sanada's just
as much an idiot, huh?

00:15:14.630 --> 00:15:16.600
We're the bigger idiots.

00:15:18.130 --> 00:15:22.530
We have no power...
Other than collecting souls.

00:15:24.530 --> 00:15:26.960
We can't do anything!
We're useless!

00:15:28.060 --> 00:15:29.130
Damn it!

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:34.930
Hello.

00:15:34.960 --> 00:15:36.160
Jonathan!

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:37.730
If he's here, then...

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:40.700
Of course, I'm here too.

00:15:40.730 --> 00:15:41.600
Izumi?!

00:15:41.700 --> 00:15:43.530
What're you doing here?!

00:15:43.700 --> 00:15:44.600
Well, well.

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:48.230
There's only one reason for a Death Spirit
to come to the human world, right?

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:49.260
What?!

00:15:49.960 --> 00:15:52.000
Work, work!

00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:53.730
Jeez!

00:15:54.530 --> 00:15:57.230
Let me see,
Yuichiro Sanada, age 56.

00:15:58.460 --> 00:16:00.030
His life span goes until today.

00:16:00.860 --> 00:16:03.930
You guys are child specialists
from pediatrics, right? Why?

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:07.360
Beats me. It was the Division Chief
of Death Spirits' order.

00:16:07.530 --> 00:16:10.200
Izumi, it's almost time.

00:16:10.630 --> 00:16:12.500
Right. Shall we get this over with?

00:16:13.260 --> 00:16:14.600
Hey! Wait!

00:16:15.060 --> 00:16:15.700
Takuto!

00:16:16.260 --> 00:16:18.430
There's nothing we can do!

00:16:19.100 --> 00:16:21.730
The code is to not interfere
with a collection!

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:26.300
Even so...
I can't forget about that old guy like this.

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:35.330
The two of them didn't come today.

00:16:37.960 --> 00:16:39.130
Takuto, Meroko.

00:16:44.030 --> 00:16:49.960
How long has it been since
I fell in love with you?

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:57.230
My feelings keep getting...

00:17:02.430 --> 00:17:04.630
I see. So you've come at last.

00:17:05.100 --> 00:17:09.160
I've come to collect your soul by the order
of the Division Chief of Death Spirits.

00:17:09.200 --> 00:17:11.600
- I'm Izumi.
- I'm Jonathan.

00:17:11.860 --> 00:17:14.960
Oh, different Death Spirits than
the ones who came before.

00:17:17.030 --> 00:17:18.560
I guess I'll miss them.

00:17:19.130 --> 00:17:21.230
It's time. Is it okay?

00:17:21.830 --> 00:17:23.560
Yeah. Please start.

00:17:35.660 --> 00:17:37.000
Are you ready?

00:17:37.100 --> 00:17:39.760
Yes. I have no more regrets.

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:43.530
Izumi! Wait!

00:17:46.100 --> 00:17:50.600
I've been waiting. I'll show you how
a Death Spirit should work.

00:17:50.830 --> 00:17:52.000
No!

00:17:54.200 --> 00:17:55.230
Mitsuki?!

00:17:57.160 --> 00:18:01.460
Please, Izumi! Please wait a little longer
before doing your work!

00:18:03.030 --> 00:18:06.260
Umm... This is some kind of mistake.

00:18:06.300 --> 00:18:08.560
There's no way that Mitsuki
can see Death Spirits!

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:09.830
You see, umm...

00:18:11.060 --> 00:18:14.400
Did you really think we hadn't noticed?

00:18:14.960 --> 00:18:17.560
You guys were lovely,
getting all worked up.

00:18:17.600 --> 00:18:18.400
You little...

00:18:18.400 --> 00:18:21.760
Oops, I'm in the middle of my work,
right now. Don't interfere, okay?

00:18:22.230 --> 00:18:24.330
No! Stop, Izumi!

00:18:24.760 --> 00:18:28.660
At least... At the very least, please
wait until his wife's roses bloom.

00:18:28.930 --> 00:18:30.400
It's okay, Mitsuki.

00:18:31.430 --> 00:18:32.560
Mr. Sanada.

00:18:32.600 --> 00:18:33.800
It's all right.

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:37.100
Please don't say that.
I don't want you to die!

00:18:37.360 --> 00:18:38.900
Listen to me.

00:18:39.400 --> 00:18:43.060
Please live the rest
of your life to the fullest.

00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:51.030
And live to the end without losing sight
of the things that are important to you.

00:18:52.130 --> 00:18:53.160
Mr. Sanada.

00:18:55.100 --> 00:18:57.600
Please don't look so tearful.

00:18:58.460 --> 00:19:02.130
I'd like the last face I see on
this earth to be a smiling face.

00:19:05.460 --> 00:19:06.330
Okay!

00:19:09.460 --> 00:19:10.130
Huh?

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:12.300
What?

00:19:12.900 --> 00:19:14.200
Okay, Mitsuki.

00:19:20.900 --> 00:19:21.800
Please.

00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:47.530
Gotcha.

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:49.000
Mission accomplished.

00:19:51.430 --> 00:19:53.630
This will happen to you soon too.

00:19:56.430 --> 00:19:58.460
At the hands of Takuto and Meroko.

00:19:59.730 --> 00:20:00.900
Izumi! You piece of...

00:20:01.030 --> 00:20:01.660
Takuto!

00:20:01.700 --> 00:20:05.200
Whoa! You can't resort to violence, Takuto.

00:20:05.230 --> 00:20:06.430
It's only the truth.

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:09.560
See you later.

00:20:15.930 --> 00:20:17.900
Mr. Sanada...
Mr. Sanada.

00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:19.500
Mr. Sanada!

00:20:29.230 --> 00:20:30.500
Mr. Sanada...

00:20:38.530 --> 00:20:40.360
Look, Mitsuki! They're blooming.

00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:45.960
They're beautiful.

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:49.760
These are the roses
his wife treasured.

00:20:59.030 --> 00:21:02.360
I'm sorry, Mitsuki.
About Mr. Sanada, well...

00:21:03.430 --> 00:21:06.360
Well... There was simply
nothing we could do.

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:11.660
Mr. Sanada might've seen
the instant those roses bloomed.

00:21:14.230 --> 00:21:18.900
Takuto! I'll sing with all my heart.
Until the end! With all my heart!

00:21:19.130 --> 00:21:20.400
So from here on,
I hope for your support, okay?

00:21:20.430 --> 00:21:21.900
Takuto? Meroko?

00:21:21.930 --> 00:21:22.800
Okay!

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:25.930
Mitsuki!

00:23:05.730 --> 00:23:09.500
Look, look, Takuto!
The romance! The drama!

00:23:09.530 --> 00:23:14.900
Will you stop?! I already know!
She got an email from Eichi, right?

00:23:15.060 --> 00:23:16.830
Gosh, what's with the attitude?

00:23:16.860 --> 00:23:19.930
This is the greatest thing
that could happen to her.

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:21.860
You could be a little happier for her.

00:23:22.030 --> 00:23:24.660
Okay, okay. Good for her.

00:23:24.930 --> 00:23:26.700
Takuto's sulking now.

00:23:27.460 --> 00:23:30.960
Next time on Full Moon:
"An E-mail from Eichi?"

00:23:31.360 --> 00:23:32.900
- Look forward to it!
- Look forward to it!
